mirantur.</HI> —Aera,  <HI REND="ITALIC">accusativus Graecus,</HI>  I.</P> 

 <P COM="0045"><COL N="0046B"></COL> 309. Confligunt,  <HI REND="ITALIC">pugnant adhuc,</HI>  I.</P> 

 <P COM="0046">311. Jam dudum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">statim.</HI> —Prodiga,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ostentatrix,</HI>  I.</P> 

