terra fretum, dum terram s. a.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0731">412. Hi duo versus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nam totum</HI>  et  <HI REND="ITALIC">Protulit,</HI>  desiderantur
in editis, exstant in Vat.</P> 

 <P COM="0731">415. Vat.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">t. nescire s.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0731">417. Sirm., Vict.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">O. migrare d.</HI>  Vat.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">O. mirata d.</HI></P> 

